<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 99,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 99,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's actual receipts 99,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales of barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Thursday. Top $57.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   County		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    55.00 -56.50	   56.00 -57.50</p>
<p>liberal volume	 55.50 -56.00	   56.50 -57.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -47.00	   44.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -52.00	   47.00 -53.00</p>
